  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is just a matter of adding something to whitelist. It's a simple terrain script which adds more variety to terrains and can help make some great looking worlds. I actually messed around with it and I made some really awesome looking stuff.\n\nOne of the main things it adds is per texture control. So you can add specular, tessellation, change albedo tint, brightness, and other stuff.\n\nBIG NOTE: There are paid modules, tessellation being one of them. But people can pick and choose which is nice.\n\nPlease consider adding this since it is just a matter of whitelisting.\n\nAsset: https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/terrain/microsplat-96478\n\n-Request by Matsix, the killer loli that enjoys making pretty maps on the side\n\nP.S. I attached a photo to show what it can do, the rocks in the water is actually a terrain texture with tessellation, the moss is too.",
